            "limits": "Source inspection only; no biased-layer GPU execution."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "summary": "Defers restoring swapped weights until after Hessian LDL decomposition to reduce GPU allocation overlap; source inspection also exposes a possible CPU-bias carryover."
